$$We divide as we do normally; notice that $10_6 \div 2_6 = 3_6$.

Note that $173 \equiv 23\pmod{50}$ and $927\equiv 27\pmod{50}$. Therefore, \begin{align*}
173\cdot 927 &\equiv 23\cdot 27 \\
&= 621 \\
&\equiv \boxed{21}\quad\pmod{50}.
\end{align*}

